  "0_outline_root": "ROOT: SKU Price > Requirements",
  "0_outline_lines": [
    "L052: \"SkuPrice MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "  L054: \"SkuPrice column presence MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "    L055: \"SkuPrice MUST include [ChargeCategory](#datasets.skuprice.chargecategory).\"",
    "    L056: \"SkuPrice MUST include [ChargeFrequency](#datasets.skuprice.chargefrequency) when the *operating model* [includes multiple charge frequencies](#conditions.includesmultiplechargefrequencies).\"",
    "    L057: \"SkuPrice MUST include [ContractCommitmentDurationType](#datasets.skuprice.contractcommitmentdurationtype) when the *operating model* [includes contract commitments](#conditions.includescontractcommitments).\"",
    "    L058: \"SkuPrice MUST include [ContractCommitmentPaymentModel](#datasets.skuprice.contractcommitmentpaymentmodel) when the *operating model* [includes contract commitments](#conditions.includescontractcommitments).\"",
    "    L059: \"SkuPrice MUST include [ContractId](#datasets.skuprice.contractid) when the *operating model* [includes contract commitments](#conditions.includescontractcommitments).\"",
    "    L060: \"SkuPrice MUST include [PricingCurrency](#datasets.skuprice.pricingcurrency).\"",
    "    L061: \"SkuPrice MUST include [PricingCurrencyCategory](#datasets.skuprice.pricingcurrencycategory).\"",
    "    L062: \"SkuPrice MUST include [PricingRegionId](#datasets.skuprice.pricingregionid) when the *operating model* [includes regions](#conditions.includesregions).\"",
    "    L063: \"SkuPrice MUST include [PricingServiceName](#datasets.skuprice.pricingservicename).\"",
    "    L064: \"SkuPrice MUST include [PricingUnit](#datasets.skuprice.pricingunit).\"",
    "    L065: \"SkuPrice MUST include [ServiceProviderName](#datasets.skuprice.serviceprovidername).\"",
    "    L066: \"SkuPrice MUST include [SkuId](#datasets.skuprice.skuid).\"",
    "    L067: \"SkuPrice MUST include [SkuPriceCreated](#datasets.skuprice.skupricecreated).\"",
    "    L068: \"SkuPrice MUST include [SkuPriceDescription](#datasets.skuprice.skupricedescription).\"",
    "    L069: \"SkuPrice MUST include [SkuPriceEffectiveEnd](#datasets.skuprice.skupriceeffectiveend).\"",
    "    L070: \"SkuPrice MUST include [SkuPriceEffectiveStart](#datasets.skuprice.skupriceeffectivestart).\"",
    "    L071: \"SkuPrice MUST include [SkuPriceEligibility](#datasets.skuprice.skupriceeligibility).\"",
    "    L072: \"SkuPrice MUST include [SkuPriceId](#datasets.skuprice.skupriceid).\"",
    "    L073: \"SkuPrice MUST include [SkuPriceLastUpdated](#datasets.skuprice.skupricelastupdated).\"",
    "    L074: \"SkuPrice MUST include [SkuPriceLifecycleStatus](#datasets.skuprice.skupricelifecyclestatus).\"",
    "    L075: \"SkuPrice MUST include [UnitPrice](#datasets.skuprice.unitprice).\"",
    "    L076: \"SkuPrice MUST include [UnitPriceCategory](#datasets.skuprice.unitpricecategory).\"",
    "    L077: \"SkuPrice MUST include [VolumeTierMaximum](#datasets.skuprice.volumetiermaximum) when the *operating model* [includes volume tier pricing](#conditions.includesvolumetierpricing).\"",
    "    L078: \"SkuPrice MUST include [VolumeTierMinimum](#datasets.skuprice.volumetierminimum) when the *operating model* [includes volume tier pricing](#conditions.includesvolumetierpricing).\"",
    "    L079: \"SkuPrice MUST include [VolumeTierName](#datasets.skuprice.volumetiername) when the *operating model* [includes volume tier pricing](#conditions.includesvolumetierpricing).\"",
    "    L080: \"SkuPrice SHOULD include [*custom columns*](#glossary:custom-column) needed to identify specific rate card routing logic when [*FOCUS columns*](#glossary:FOCUS-column) are not sufficient.\"",
    "  L081: \"SkuPrice MUST conform to [DatasetCompleteness](#attributes.datasetcompleteness) requirements.\"",
    "  L082: \"SkuPrice MUST conform to [DatasetConfiguration](#attributes.datasetconfiguration) requirements.\"",
    "  L083: \"SkuPrice MUST maintain row uniqueness across the composite key of ServiceProviderName, SkuPriceId, ContractId, VolumeTierMinimum, SkuPriceEffectiveStart, PricingCurrency, and UnitPriceCategory.\"",
    "  L084: \"SkuPrice MUST treat two records with a null value in the same composite-key member as equal in that member when evaluating row uniqueness.\"",
    "  L085: \"SkuPrice MUST NOT contain records whose validity periods, defined by SkuPriceEffectiveStart and SkuPriceEffectiveEnd, overlap for the same combination of ServiceProviderName, SkuPriceId, ContractId, VolumeTierMinimum, PricingCurrency, and UnitPriceCategory.\"",
    "  L086: \"SkuPrice MUST contain at least one record for every [SkuPriceId](#datasets.skuprice.skupriceid) referenced in the [CostAndUsage](#datasets.costandusage) dataset.\"",
    "  L087: \"SkuPrice *FOCUS columns* MUST conform to [FocusColumnHandling](#attributes.focuscolumnhandling) requirements.\"",
    "  L088: \"SkuPrice *FOCUS columns* MUST conform to [NullHandling](#attributes.nullhandling) requirements.\"",
    "  L089: \"SkuPrice *custom columns* MUST conform to [CustomColumnHandling](#attributes.customcolumnhandling) requirements.\""
  ],
